Copied from the Up Rough Demo System vendor copy (amiga/vendor/kalms-c2p), which
redirects NDK includes to c2p_equates.i (lines tagged "*--- PORT") and wraps the
BPLX/BPLY/BPLSIZE/CHUNKYXMAX/CHUNKYYMAX equates in IFND guards. No routine logic
is changed.

Vendored subset (Selecta I439, M4-P6-1): normal/c2p1x1_8_c5_040 (68040/68060,
runtime bplsize, used by backend_aga.c), normal/c2p1x1_8_c5_030 and
normal/c2p1x1_8_c5_gen (68030 and 68020; BPLSIZE is an assembly-time equate,
not wired yet), readme.txt, howto.txt, history.txt, c2p_equates.i.
